// One firing event, built from a single source: the barrel ammo counter. A record
// exists exactly where the counter stepped down, and the counter names the barrel,
// the slot and so the ammo. The report stream is cut into records by the gun's own
// rate of fire: a pause longer than the reported rounds needed at that rate is a
// released trigger, not one burst.
//
